 "remarks": "Sophisticated, sun-filled and beautifully updated, this exceptional 949 sq. ft. corner one-bedroom is among the largest in the complex, offering gracious proportions and effortless, move-in-ready living. Set within a distinctive pre-war building, an enchanting English-inspired courtyard framed by ivy-clad brick and exquisite plantings creates a peaceful outdoor retreat in the heart of the city. Recently fully painted, abundant natural light fills the home throughout the day, with spectacular bedroom sunset views. Soaring 9-foot ceilings and refinished hardwood floors enhance the sense of space and character, newer windows, stylish bath and thoughtfully updated kitchen bring a fresh, modern feel. Heat and hot water included. Ideally positioned just minutes from downtown, award winning restaurants, theatres, Metro-North and CT Transit, this special residence offers a rare blend of timeless architectural charm, stylish updates, generous living space and exceptional convenience, in the most desirable location in the heart of the city.",
